          "settings": {
            "label": "01 — Material",
            "heading": "Canvas, wax, and full-grain leather",
            "text": "<p>Every piece starts with materials chosen to age well: waxed cotton canvas, vegetable-tanned leather, and brass hardware built to be repaired, not replaced.</p>",
