            "button_label": "Shop the line",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/frontpage"
          }
        },
        "c2": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "label": "02 — Field test",
            "heading": "Broken in on the road",
            "text": "<p>Prototypes rode along on a season of early starts and long routes — sun, dust, daily wear — until the canvas softened and the leather took its first patina.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/route-field-midday.png"
          }
        },
        "c3": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "label": "03 — Release",
            "heading": "One line, built to last",
            "text": "<p>The finished collection ships as a coordinated set — shell, carry, layers — each piece meant to be worn for years, not seasons.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/card-04-overland-cargo.png",
            "button_label": "Shop the drop",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/frontpage"
          }
        }
